# Web app conventions

Route groups:
- `(auth)` login
- `(pos)` cashier register
- `(backoffice)` manager
- `(scan)` mobile scanner pages

POS UX: cart right, scanner-ready search, large total, F2/F4/F6/F8/F9 shortcuts, Inter + tabular-nums.

Offline: cash + catalog/cart only; queue sync; no new online/MM pay offline.

Use `@gulio/ui` and `@gulio/contracts`. Do not treat client stock as source of truth.
